# The scheduled ticks (the container runs on host time — see
# /etc/localtime in the compose file): news every 20 min,
# timetables every 6 h, faculty info and housekeeping daily at
# night. There is no startup one-shot: cron fires on schedule
# whatever the containers did, so a restart storm never hammers
# the source sites. Push receipts need no line — the watcher
# thread lives in the process that sends (notifications/push.py).
*/20 * * * *  docker exec knfapp-django python3 manage.py scrape_news
15 */6 * * *  docker exec knfapp-django python3 manage.py scrape_schedule
40 3 * * *    docker exec knfapp-django python3 manage.py scrape_info
20 4 * * *    docker exec knfapp-django python3 manage.py maintenance
